  <!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->
  <section class="lio-lp-review__intro">
    <div class="lio-lp-review__wrap">
      <p>If you&rsquo;re trying to break a vaping, smoking, or nail-biting habit, you&rsquo;ve probably realized the obvious thing nobody told you: the chemical is only half the problem. The other half is the ritual &mdash; the hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breath, the little hit of relief &mdash; and patches and gum do nothing for it.</p>
      <p>That&rsquo;s why the flavored air device category has exploded. These products deliver the ritual &mdash; the pull, the flavor, the exhale &mdash; without the nicotine, tobacco, or chemicals. The problem: the category is crowded, quality varies wildly, and some &ldquo;nicotine-free&rdquo; devices still contain a heating element and produce actual vapor (which defeats half the point).</p>
      <p>We spent 8 weeks testing 7 of the most-searched brands across real-world conditions &mdash; at home, at work, on flights, at social events, and during moments of peak craving. We evaluated ritual fidelity, flavor quality, portability, usability, build quality, and value.</p>
      <p>Here&rsquo;s what we found.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

